{
  "name": "MCP vs API: the same Evaboot export, both ways",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MCP vs API: the same export, both ways\n\nSet **Your settings**: a Sales Navigator **lead list** URL with 10 leads or fewer.\n\nOne credential for both branches: **Bearer Auth** with your Evaboot API key (dash.evaboot.com > Integrations > API).\n\nEach branch costs 1 credit per lead. Setup guide: docs/n8n.md",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "0b588d75-4f48-444d-9064-3028629d07b5",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Through the MCP server\nTwo MCP Client calls. `max_results` caps the export, so a big search cannot overspend.",
        "width": 900,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "614f2f77-96ed-463b-bca2-36d2f050b81f",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        -240
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Through the REST API\nYou write the HTTP calls and the polling loop yourself. The API exports the **whole** search or list: there is no cap.",
        "width": 1300,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "e4050f2c-d5ea-4c61-94c8-892f68f29e3f",
      "name": "Note 2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        420,
        110
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "fe6a327e-b2c6-434f-8648-1df435ec35ee",
      "name": "Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -400,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "u",
              "name": "list_url",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://www.linkedin.com/sales/lists/people/REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_LIST_ID"
            },
            {
              "id": "n",
              "name": "max_results",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 10
            },
            {
              "id": "t",
              "name": "started_at",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "2d5317b6-e8d8-40be-ad09-97ca14487978",
      "name": "Your settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -160,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "endpointUrl": "https://mcp.evaboot.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "bearerAuth",
        "tool": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "export_sn_search_or_list",
          "cachedResultName": "export_sn_search_or_list"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ search_url: $('Your settings').first().json.list_url, name: 'MCP vs API test (n8n, MCP)', max_results: $('Your settings').first().json.max_results }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "47a48190-88e1-41ad-a44d-e74d4b2330a7",
      "name": "MCP: export",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        480,
        -40
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpBearerAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Evaboot (Bearer API key)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 30
      },
      "id": "c77e79a7-54ca-4d32-92d0-4a8328440dce",
      "name": "MCP: wait 30 s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        700,
        -40
      ],
      "webhookId": "57139b69-3111-415b-8f3e-3488625e32d0"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "endpointUrl": "https://mcp.evaboot.com/mcp",
        "authentication": "bearerAuth",
        "tool": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "get_export",
          "cachedResultName": "get_export"
        },
        "inputMode": "json",
        "jsonInput": "={{ JSON.stringify({ extraction_id: $('MCP: export').first().json.structuredContent?.result?.extraction_id || $('MCP: export').first().json.result?.extraction_id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        }
      },
      "id": "9d5e2b5c-a472-4a7b-95e8-04bb2e8c96c4",
      "name": "MCP: results",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpClient",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        920,
        -40
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpBearerAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Evaboot (Bearer API key)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "f",
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.structuredContent?.result || $json.result || {}).status }}",
              "rightValue": "EXECUTED",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "id": "54abe053-c66a-4445-9af2-96b6a3464df0",
      "name": "MCP: finished?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
